  "historyNote": "#7647, eff 2-16-02 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 2100) (formerly Env-Wm 3906.04); ss by #9645, eff 2-16-10; ss by #12605, eff 9-1-18",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
